==English==
===Initialism===

'''G.I.'''

#{{alternative spelling of|GI}}Always pronounced as intials "gee ai", stands for "government issue(d)". As a noun, ''GI'' refers to a member of a US military service, as in "G.I. Joe"; originally pejorative as it implied that U.S. soldiers were nothing but interchangable units (Government Issue(d) Joe) that could be requisitioned like any other supplies.

